    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "text": "In other words, the causal relationship isn't always spelled out in obvious terms in translations of sentences with 'node', hence the 'and' option.",
      "html": "In other words, the causal relationship isn't always spelled out in obvious terms in translations of sentences with 'node', hence the 'and' option.",
